  "scope": "Optional direct-peer TCP limit, disabled by default, shared native-worker index, canonical IPv4-mapped addresses and physical transport leases. Both public ingresses enforce their own cap. No forwarded-header trust or per-message policy work.18 sequential before/disabled/enabled timing cases exclude builds, profiles and competing load. Six separate heap diagnostics isolate footprint, preserve four-worker capacity noise and fix single-worker capacity. Four independent release overload cases verify preservation of another address and lease reuse.",
